 "teaches": [
  "One CalendarMonth call with year 2026 and month 11 and ten days of events: the grid, today, dots or chips, the selection and the agenda are the template's. About 4 KB of JSON",
  "A fixed month because the events are dated: the same day numbers in another month would be false. Today is still marked from the clock while it is November 2026",
  "Phone: up to three dots in the events' colours under each day; desktop and tablet: the titles as chips, +N more when a day has more than fit",
  "The plus button sits in headerEnd and sends hostNamedAction addEvent with the selected day"
 ],
